{"watch":23,"start":6600,"events":[{"seq":1410,"t":6600,"type":"watch","watch":23},{"seq":1411,"t":6600,"type":"decode","house":"rhino","letter":"L314","text":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","readable":true},{"seq":1412,"t":6600,"type":"decode","house":"kite","letter":"L386","text":"ELEPHANTS, HOLD AT NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","readable":true},{"seq":1413,"t":6600,"type":"decode","house":"kite","letter":"L385","text":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","readable":true},{"seq":1414,"t":6600,"type":"decode","house":"orchid","letter":"L243","text":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","readable":true},{"seq":1415,"t":6600,"type":"decode","house":"orchid","letter":"L281","text":"HORSE, SCO_T SO_TH BANK MIDDLE.","readable":true},{"seq":1416,"t":6600,"type":"decode","house":"orchid","letter":"L280","text":"BO_MEN, HOLD AT NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","readable":true},{"seq":1417,"t":6600,"type":"model","house":"rhino","model":"local:local","tokens":1897,"retries":0},{"seq":1418,"t":6600,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"It is Watch 23. My doctrine is to take and hold the middle ford (F2). I have units near F2 (rhino-inf-2 at F2, rhino-ele-1 near F2). Kite is strong at N-Mid (100 inf). I must reinforce F2 and maintain my hold. I will send a cipher order to secure F2 against the known threats."},{"seq":1419,"t":6600,"type":"courier","id":"c351","house":"rhino","letter":"L434","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-2","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2"],"depart":6900,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"RANKJS BKKT, DKHS MT IESSHA BKQS."},{"seq":1420,"t":6600,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1922,"retries":0},{"seq":1421,"t":6600,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"It is Watch 23. My doctrine is to take the middle ford (F2) in the first 5 watches, which is past. I must now act on enemy mail and secure F2. Rhino is active at NBM, and Orchid is at F2 (5w ago). I will move my forces to F2, prioritizing holding it, and use cipher for all orders"},{"seq":1422,"t":6600,"type":"courier","id":"c352","house":"kite","letter":"L435","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village"],"depart":6900,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":"BEQRS BKKS, ITQLD SK JKQSD ATJG IEOOHN."},{"seq":1423,"t":6600,"type":"courier","id":"c353","house":"kite","letter":"L436","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-2","path":["kite-camp"],"depart":6900,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":"RNLKJO BKKS, ITQLD SK RKUSD ATJG IEOOHN."},{"seq":1424,"t":6600,"type":"courier","id":"c354","house":"kite","letter":"L437","kind":"order","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp"],"depart":6900,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":"AKWINJ, ITQLD SK JKQSD ATJG IEOOHN."},{"seq":1425,"t":6600,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":2193,"retries":0},{"seq":1426,"t":6600,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"It is Watch 23/30. Tiger is allied. Rhino and Kite are active near our borders. I must follow doctrine: 1. Two riders. 2. Decoys. 3. Make a friend (already done with Tiger). I will use decoys against Rhino and Kite, and try to secure F1/F2/F3 positions.\n\nMy forces are spread out."},{"seq":1427,"t":6600,"type":"courier","id":"c355","house":"orchid","letter":"L438","kind":"order","to":"orchid-cav-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1","n-west"],"depart":6600,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1428,"t":6600,"type":"courier","id":"c356","house":"orchid","letter":"L439","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-2","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1"],"depart":6900,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":"RMOKJS AKKT, DKHS BT WMRT AKQS."},{"seq":1429,"t":6600,"type":"courier","id":"c357","house":"orchid","letter":"L440","kind":"letter","to":"rhino-camp","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1","n-west","rhino-camp"],"depart":6900,"plain":"WE SEEK PEACE","cipher":"WM RMMG NMBOM"},{"seq":1430,"t":6600,"type":"courier","i